WEBVTT

00:05:57.353 --> 00:06:00.314
I know we can protect everything

00:06:00.314 --> 00:06:03.526
that technology
might make possible tomorrow,

00:06:03.526 --> 00:06:08.489
but only if we ban
surveillance abuses today.

00:06:08.489 --> 00:06:09.782
Thank you.

00:06:09.782 --> 00:06:11.158
(Applause)